 "strings": {
  "About what?": "",
  "I'm not actually ex-Kajihira.\nThat wasn't the truth.": "",
  "About being ex-Kajihira...\nAnd everything else.": "",
  "Neither was my name.": "",
  "Even my name.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I...\nI actually know you from a long time ago.": "",
  "I've actually known who you are\nfor a long time now, Yagami-san.": "",
  "That's the whole reason\nI approached you.": "",
  "That's why I approached you.": "",
  "My real name, Yagami-san...": "",
  "My real name is actually...": "",
  "Fumiya Terasawa.": "",
  "Terasawa...?": "",
  "Terasawa?": "",
  "I'm the younger brother of Emi...\nWho this bastard murdered!": "",
  "The younger brother of Emi Terasawa,\nwho you burned to death.": "",
  "Sugiura!": "",
  "Nobody move!": "",
  "You in the hood!\nDrop the knife!": "",
  "You there!\nDrop the knife!": "",
  "Now!": "",
  "You're under arrest for attempted murder.": "",
  "The cuffs won't be necessary.": "",
  "No need for cuffs.": "",
  "He's no longer a threat.": "",
  "Don't worry about your friend.\nWe won't bother prosecuting him.": "",
  "Don't worry about him.\nHe's not worth prosecuting.": "",
  "You sure?": "",
  "No crime was committed here.": "",
  "No harm came of it anyway.": "",
  "But sir, we can't just—": "",
  "But, sir!": "",
  "You need to get forensics in here.": "",
  "You oughta get forensics in here.": "",
  "There's a good chance a series\nof murders took place in this very room.": "",
  "I believe this is where\na few murders took place.": "",
  "And what brings you to say that?": "",
  "What makes you think that?": "",
  "Kido told me about it.": "",
  "Kido told me all about it.": "",
  "Unfortunately, we'll need a stronger\npremise than that.": "",
  "We'll need much stronger\nevidence than conjecture.": "",
  "They would never issue a warrant\non such grounds.": "",
  "The court wouldn't even\nissue a warrant on that.": "",
  "Well then it's a good thing\nI have a better reason lined up.": "",
  "Then I'll make sure\nthey'll issue a warrant.": "",
  "Which is what?": "",
  "How, exactly?": "",
  "Trespassing charges against\na rogue ex-lawyer.": "",
  "By arresting someone caught\nin the act of trespassing.": "",
  "Which makes this...\nA crime scene.": "",
  "In other words...\nThis is a crime scene now.": "",
  "Guess you'll have to block it off.\nPreserve the evidence, you know?": "",
  "And you'll have to seal it off\nto preserve the evidence.": "",
  "Yagami-kun...": "",
  "How clever. You don't mind being arrested\nif it means helping your investigation.": "",
  "I see. So it's worth being arrested\nto get us to investigate this place?": "",
  "I suppose this was your plan from the start.": "",
  "This was your plan all along, I suspect.": "",
  "That's why you had\nFujii-kun get the police involved.": "",
  "That's why you had\nFujii-kun bring the police.": "",
  "You surprise me.": "",
  "You're a piece of work.": "",
  "Out of the way!\nLet me through!": "",
  "Step aside!\nOut of the way!": "",
  "Vice Minister Ichinose!": "",
  "Vice Minister Ichinose...": "",
  "This place is under\nthe Ministry of Health's jurisdiction!": "",
  "This facility is the\nMinistry of Health's jurisdiction!": "",
  "I demand you leave here at once!": "",
  "You're not authorized to be here!": "",
  "Huh, I didn't realize you guys\nwere in the love hotel business... Vice Minister.": "",
  "Wow... So the Health Ministry\nruns love hotels now?": "",
  "It's a laboratory.\nA top secret research facility for AD-9.": "",
  "Regardless of its appearance,\nthis is an AD-9 research lab!": "",
  "You have no idea of\nthe fallout this could cause!": "",
  "This facility is where we store\nhighly classified data!": "",
  "Then let's find out.\nIf you didn't notice, I just trespassed. Meaning...": "",
  "Yeah, sorry about that,\nbut I just trespassed on it.": "",
  "This whole laboratory\nis a crime scene now.": "",
  "The police have to cordon it off...": "",
  "Isn't that right?": "",
  "Don't you?": "",
  "Hmm. I'm not sure that's\ngoing to work, Yagami-san.": "",
  "...I'm afraid it doesn't\nwork that way, Yagami-san.": "",
  "At least four people were murdered in here.": "",
  "At least four people were killed here.\nI know it.": "",
  "I'm sure of it!\nThe proof's right here in this room.": "",
  "You <font_kind=yakuza_italic>will</font_kind> find the evidence.": "",
  "So please. ": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor.": "",
  "I'm begging you to help me here.": "",
  "Gamble or not, you need to stand firm.": "",
  "What a conundrum.": "",
  "How unfortunate...": "",
  "You see, none of that is my concern.": "",
  "That's not really the issue.": "",
  "Man...": "",
  "You should be thankin' your lucky stars\nwe haven't beaten the crap outta you by now.": "",
  "We always called assholes\nlike you tax leeches...": "",
  "Shit, almost makes ya feel\nbad for the poor guy.": "",
  "Still, can't help but feel for ya.": "",
  "Even if he deserves it.": "",
  "Even if you did have it coming.": "",
  "You smoke?": "",
  "Smoke?": "",
  "Man, you're as soft as ever,\nKaito-aniki.": "",
  "You never lost that\nsoft touch, did you, aniki?": "",
  "Hi.": "",
  "Humor me. According to you,\nthis is a secret research facility for AD-9.": "",
  "You said this was an AD-9\nresearch lab, correct?": "",
  "Yes, Vice Minister?": "",
  "Vice Minister Ichinose?": "",
  "Exactly right.": "",
  "Hm. Our nation's government...\nhas invested countless resources into AD-9.": "",
  "The country has invested countless\nresources into AD-9's development.": "",
  "It would seem rather foolish if\nwe were to stop its momentum over this.": "",
  "It would be negligent to put a stop\nto that over a trespassing charge.": "",
  "I'm willing to overlook it for AD-9's sake.": "",
  "The situation calls for some flexibility.": "",
  "But... Sir!": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor!": "",
  "Many thanks.\nTruly, I am in your debt.": "",
  "Your understanding is\ngreatly appreciated.": "",
  "Of course, Vice Minister.": "",
  "Then we'll take our leave.": "",
  "Now. Everyone is to evacuate\nthe premises at once.": "",
  "Everyone here is to\nvacate the premises.": "",
  "I hope you can continue your research\ninto AD-9 without any more disturbances.": "",
  "We look forward to\nAD-9's deployment, Dr. Shono.": "",
  "Let me assure you, Dr. Shono.\nThis will not happen again.": "",
  "We'll do our part to keep\nyou free of disturbances.": "",
  "Chief Prosecutor...": "",
  "Meaning...": "",
  "Don't tell me...": "",
  "You're working for AD-9, too,\naren't you Chief Prosecutor?": "",
  "You're entangled in this\nAD-9 cesspool too?": "",
  "Dammit... ": "",
  "Shit...": "",
  "Aniki...": "",
  "That goddamn... bastard...": "",
  "Fucking... asshole!": "",
  "It's time for you to go home, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Please see your way out, Yagami-san.　": "",
  "Just how long have you\nand Morita been working together?": "",
  "How long have you had\nChief Morita in your pocket?": "",
  "AD-9 has many influential supporters.": "",
  "AD-9 has allies in every corner.": "",
  "There's no stopping our momentum.": "",
  "Try as you might, you can't stop us.": "",
  "Bullshit there's not.": "",
  "That's some bullshit.": "",
  "I am not gonna let you win that easy.": "",
  "And there's no way\nI'm ever giving up.": "",
  "Ah, oh yes.": "",
  "Oh, right.": "",
  "I should let you know that I just\nreceived a call from Director Kido.": "",
  "I got a call from Dr. Kido earlier.": "",
  "Kuroiwa sends his regards.": "",
  "He's with Detective Kuroiwa\nat the moment.": "",
  "Apparently he rescued Kido.\nHe's been freed.": "",
  "I'm told he had to be rescued\nfrom a couple of ruffians.": "",
  "Local thugs have made Kamurocho\ntoo dangerous for him.": "",
  "Kamurocho is too dangerous\nfor a man like him, hm?": "",
  "Well, you're right.\nFor now, I guess.": "",
  "I see.\nI think that's simple enough.": "",
  "It's easy to tell how the case'll go.\nWe just don't have quite enough evidence yet.": "",
  "I can tell what our chances of winning\nare by the side you're taking.": "",
  "There's no way we'll take down Ichinose\nwith what we've got at the moment.": "",
  "Basically, we don't have\nenough ammo to flip you yet.": "",
  "I appreciate the advice.": "",
  "I'll keep that in mind.": "",
  "Not yet, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hold on, Yagami-san!": "",
  "He's trying to take us for fools.": "",
  "He's underestimating us!": "",
  "I can make him talk for sure.\nAll we have to do is push the video—": "",
  "If we commit to releasing\nthat video, I'm sure he's—": "",
  "We'd be wasting our time.": "",
  "You can't say that if you don't try!\nCome on, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Shouldn't we at least try!?\nOr are you giving up?": "",
  "I said we're not doing it.": "",
  "I'm not giving up.": "",
  "Please, just give it a shot!": "",
  "Then let's go for it!": "",
  "If the video doesn't work...\nthen we'll find some other way to—": "",
  "We'll worry about what's next\nif the video doesn't work!": "",
  "There's no point.": "",
  "Don't be ridiculous.": "",
  "No point!?\nThat's enough of the tough detective act!": "",
  "Ridiculous!? Is there still a point\nto this tough-guy act!?": "",
  "You can't run!": "",
  "Or are you going to run!?": "",
  "Hoshino!": "",
  "I never said anything about\nrunning away, okay?": "",
  "This isn't what running\naway looks like.": "",
  "But... I just...": "",
  "I-I just... ": "",
  "...I don't wanna lose.": "",
  "I'm trying to...": "",
  "I thought I could help you!": "",
  "I just want to win!": "",
  "Having a falling out, are we?": "",
  "Looks like trouble in paradise?": "",
  "Once I have my proof...\nI'll be back.": "",
  "I'll be back when\nI've got a shot at winning.": "",
  "Heh. And when you do...\nI will gladly cooperate.": "",
  "I'd be happy to cooperate\nif and when you do.": "",
  "Not that I'm expecting much.": "",
  "But it's a pretty big \"if.\"": "",
  "Your \"guilt\" is nothing more\nthan an act.": "",
  "Your \"guilt\" is just an act.": "",
  "Do you even realize what\nit is you're doing?": "",
  "Do you even know\nwhat you've done?": "",
  "Be quiet.": "",
  "How do you think your brother would feel\nif he saw what you were doing now? Huh?": "",
  "You think this is the dream\nyour brother had for you? Eh?": "",
  "Tell me, Morita!": "",
  "Shut up. Just...": "",
  "I said be quiet!　": "",
  "If you want me to shut up...\nyou're gonna have to kill me.": "",
  "You'll have to kill me\nto shut me up.": "",
  "Morita. Okubo-kun and Ayabe\nare depending on me.": "",
  "I'm representing both\nOkubo-kun and Ayabe.": "",
  "Emi Terasawa deserves justice, too.": "",
  "And Emi-chan deserves justice.": "",
  "And I'm not stopping until I get it!": "",
  "So I will not just shut up!": "",
  "Hey Tak... Kuroiwa's here.": "",
  "Tak. Kuroiwa's here.": "",
  "I believe that's enough...\nMorita-san.": "",
  "Shall I take it from here,\nChief Prosecutor?": "",
  "Long time no see.": "",
  "Good to see you again.": "",
  "Seems you're already back in action.": "",
  "You're fully recovered already?": "",
  "Heh. Guess I went too easy.": "",
  "I must have been too soft.": "",
  "So, another two versus one fight?": "",
  "You going to try to\ndouble-team me again?": "",
  "Is Yagami joining us?": "",
  "This time with Yagami?": "",
  "What are you doing here?": "",
  "Why are you here!?": "",
  "I suggest you turn a blind eye to this.\nYou're good at that, aren't you?": "",
  "I suggest looking the other way.\nYou're good at that.": "",
  "Think you could stay out of this?": "",
  "Mind sitting this one out?": "",
  "Like hell I will.": "",
  "What the hell?": ""
 },
